WEBVTT

NOTE key=7d79d32aafa411d0

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.591
A black crow is in a tree.

2
00:00:02.091 --> 00:00:03.426
She has a piece of cheese.

3
00:00:03.926 --> 00:00:05.598
A fox looks up at the crow.

4
00:00:06.098 --> 00:00:07.723
"You are very beautiful," he says.

5
00:00:08.223 --> 00:00:10.766
"Your eyes are bright, and your wings shine."

6
00:00:11.266 --> 00:00:12.810
"Can you sing for me, please?"

7
00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:15.690
The crow is happy, and she opens her mouth.

8
00:00:16.190 --> 00:00:17.978
The cheese falls down to the fox.

9
00:00:18.478 --> 00:00:21.101
"Thank you," says the fox, and he runs away.
